Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:52:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST War: flags SiegeStay, SiegePosture,
 DeclareAtBorder (off in the bundle)

- SiegeStay (CvTacticalAI::PlotHealMoves): units within reach of a damaged
  enemy city stay at the siege unless below a third of their HP or projected
  to die, instead of leaving to heal at 20 damage.
- SiegePosture (CvTacticalAI::PlotAttritionAttacks): the attrition posture
  also runs the city attack at AL_LOW, so ranged units bombard the city.
  ExecuteCaptureCityMoves takes the aggression level (default AL_HIGH).
- DeclareAtBorder (CvAIOperationMilitary::CheckTransitionToNextStage): a
  sneak attack counts as discovered only in or next to the target's
  territory or within 2x deploy range of the target.

Flag names appended in CvPlayer.h/.cpp (CandidateFixTypes,
kCandidateFixNames); all three are left out of kCandidateFixBundle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZizcmgfGkXsgJcVcF7h
